\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O safe to the rock that is 
\par higher than I,
\par My soul in its conflicts and 
\par sorrows would fly,
\par So sinful, so weary, Thine, Thine
\par would I be,
\par Thou blest Rock of Ages, I'm
\par hiding in Thee!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Hiding in Thee! Hiding in Thee!
\par Thou blest Rock of Ages, I'm
\par hiding in Thee!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. In the calm of the noontide, in
\par sorrow's lone hour,
\par In times when temptation casts
\par o'er me its power;
\par In the tempests of life, on its 
\par wide heaving sea,
\par Thou blest Rock of Ages, I'm
\par hiding in Thee!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Hiding in Thee! Hiding in Thee!
\par Thou blest Rock of Ages, I'm
\par hiding in Thee!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. How oft in the conflict, when
\par pressed by the foe,
\par I have fled to my refuge, and 
\par breathed out my woe:
\par How often, when trials, like
\par sea-billows roll,
\par Have I hidden in Thee, O Thou
\par Rock of my soul.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Hiding in Thee! Hiding in Thee!
\par Thou blest Rock of Ages, I'm
\par hiding in Thee!
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

